    "name": "Deck of Anubis",
    "steam_appid": 3653660,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653660/extras/a24fe32424d3e6890128ec19cefbe369.poster.avif?t=1753966093\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653660/extras/a24fe32424d3e6890128ec19cefbe369.webm?t=1753966093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653660/extras/a24fe32424d3e6890128ec19cefbe369.mp4?t=1753966093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, newly awakened soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve crossed the threshold into the Duat \u2014 the Egyptian realm of the dead. Guided by Anubis, keeper of souls and lord of sacred rites, you must walk the path of judgment. Ignore the whispers of jackal-headed guides and shadow beasts. These are only echoes of your former life. They will fade. Hopefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now your true journey begins:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild your spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face mythic trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive divine judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And \u2014 if you\u2019re strong enough \u2014 rise beside Ra as he battles the chaos serpent Apep and guides the sun through eternal night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been dealt a standard 52-card deck \u2014 but it won\u2019t stay standard for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master <strong>Chains</strong>, <strong>Block</strong> spiritual attacks, and play <strong>Gambit</strong> cards that twist the very rules of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft divine <strong>Blessings</strong> from the Book of the Dead, barter for relics, and sacrifice what little power you hold to grow stronger\u2026 or vanish forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anubis watches. The gods await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fate lies in the cards.\u00a0Play\u00a0wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Roguelike Deck-builder</strong> \u2013 Build your strategy with every run. Ascend, fall, and return with new cards, blessings, and knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Strategic 52-Card Combat</strong> \u2013 Familiar cards, reimagined for tactical play. Create Chains, counter threats, and stack devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Gambits\u00a0</strong>\u2013 High-risk rule-breaking cards let you twist fate \u2014 but every choice comes with a cost. What will you give up for power?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Sacrifice anything\u00a0</strong>\u2013 What will you give up for power? Money, Blessings and even Blood, everything is tradeable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Divine Blessings\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Choose blessings from the gods that alter your build. Passive effects, ability boosts, and unique synergy paths await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Mythological Theme</strong> \u2013 Travel beautiful maps, meet trials, puzzles, and monsters drawn from the Egyptian <i>Book of the Dead</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>A Journey of the Soul </strong>\u2013 Follow a rich, myth-infused narrative across the gates of the Duat, the river of night, and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653660/extras/d2713d7f2d37fb2ae9ca90c4fc22c322.poster.avif?t=1753966093\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653660/extras/d2713d7f2d37fb2ae9ca90c4fc22c322.webm?t=1753966093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653660/extras/d2713d7f2d37fb2ae9ca90c4fc22c322.mp4?t=1753966093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR DECK, BATTLE THROUGH THE DEAD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a step deeper into the underworld. Fight smarter, draft better, and master your deck. Do you block now, or build your combo? Do you trade that blessing? or risk it all on your next Gambit?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Duat changes each time \u2014 but the gods are always watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ORDER VS. CHAOS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the few chosen to stand with Ra against <strong>Apep</strong>, the embodiment of chaos. As the sun sails through the underworld, monsters rise, rules bend, and sacrifices must be made. Your victory keeps the world in balance. Your failure feeds the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, traveler. The afterlife is anything but restful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653660/extras/35fbdef5c58a951f8411833d2272f6ea.poster.avif?t=1753966093\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653660/extras/35fbdef5c58a951f8411833d2272f6ea.webm?t=1753966093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653660/extras/35fbdef5c58a951f8411833d2272f6ea.mp4?t=1753966093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653660/extras/a24fe32424d3e6890128ec19cefbe369.poster.avif?t=1753966093\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653660/extras/a24fe32424d3e6890128ec19cefbe369.webm?t=1753966093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653660/extras/a24fe32424d3e6890128ec19cefbe369.mp4?t=1753966093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, newly awakened soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve crossed the threshold into the Duat \u2014 the Egyptian realm of the dead. Guided by Anubis, keeper of souls and lord of sacred rites, you must walk the path of judgment. Ignore the whispers of jackal-headed guides and shadow beasts. These are only echoes of your former life. They will fade. Hopefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now your true journey begins:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild your spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face mythic trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive divine judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And \u2014 if you\u2019re strong enough \u2014 rise beside Ra as he battles the chaos serpent Apep and guides the sun through eternal night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been dealt a standard 52-card deck \u2014 but it won\u2019t stay standard for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master <strong>Chains</strong>, <strong>Block</strong> spiritual attacks, and play <strong>Gambit</strong> cards that twist the very rules of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft divine <strong>Blessings</strong> from the Book of the Dead, barter for relics, and sacrifice what little power you hold to grow stronger\u2026 or vanish forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anubis watches. The gods await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fate lies in the cards.\u00a0Play\u00a0wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Roguelike Deck-builder</strong> \u2013 Build your strategy with every run. Ascend, fall, and return with new cards, blessings, and knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Strategic 52-Card Combat</strong> \u2013 Familiar cards, reimagined for tactical play. Create Chains, counter threats, and stack devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Gambits\u00a0</strong>\u2013 High-risk rule-breaking cards let you twist fate \u2014 but every choice comes with a cost. What will you give up for power?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Sacrifice anything\u00a0</strong>\u2013 What will you give up for power? Money, Blessings and even Blood, everything is tradeable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Divine Blessings\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Choose blessings from the gods that alter your build. Passive effects, ability boosts, and unique synergy paths await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Mythological Theme</strong> \u2013 Travel beautiful maps, meet trials, puzzles, and monsters drawn from the Egyptian <i>Book of the Dead</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>A Journey of the Soul </strong>\u2013 Follow a rich, myth-infused narrative across the gates of the Duat, the river of night, and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653660/extras/d2713d7f2d37fb2ae9ca90c4fc22c322.poster.avif?t=1753966093\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653660/extras/d2713d7f2d37fb2ae9ca90c4fc2